<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="2">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Desk Secret Service Introduction</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But first, as March Madness comes to a close. Americans, and Ted Cruz, are looking for a new college sporting event.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GRAPHIC: Drunken Frat Guys with Solo Cups</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Luckily, the collegiate fraternal system is squeezing into that hole.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Recently, multiple fraternities have come under public scrutiny. So let’s bring up the board.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GRAPHIC: SCOREBOARD PRICKS </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">vs</Text>
      <Text> DECENCY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Today we’ve got racists, rapists, and pricks: the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">ol’</Text>
      <Text> fighting Greeks against decency. Let’s take a look at the recent headlines and see who comes out on top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>First up, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">SAE</Text>
      <Text>. Sigma Alpha Epsilon. Or as the ladies call it: Sexual Assault Expected.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The Oklahoma chapter recently closed after video surfaced of frat members performing a racist chant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>VIDEO: Racist Chant</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec looks and points to the scoreboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GRAPHIC: SCOREBOARD PRICKS 1 DECENCY 0</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The University of Virginia was recently exposed by Rolling Stone for a rape at Phi Kappa Psi. The students have now been exonerated as police have found no evidence of a party the night the accuser said the rape “went down.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GRAPHIC: SCOREBOARD PRICKS 1 DECENCY 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But, don’t go changing those brackets just yet folks. Racists, Rapists and Pricks aren’t the kind to take this lying down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>As Alec reads, the headlines scroll past like a stock ticker.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Rutgers</Text>
      <Text> University’s Sigma Phi Epsilon shut down after intoxicated student rushed to hospital.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(ding)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">UW</Text>
      <Text> Madison’s Chi Phi terminated after hazing allegations.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(ding)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Penn</Text>
      <Text> State’s Kappa Delta Rho’s illicit </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Facebook</Text>
      <Text> photos may lead to criminal charges.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(ding)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Elon</Text>
      <Text> University, Pi Kappa Phi: hazing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(ding)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">UC</Text>
      <Text> Santa Barbara, Phi Sigma Kappa: hazing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(ding)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>University of Michigan’s Sigma Alpha Mu permanently dissolved for destroying a ski resort.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Full Screen Graphic: Destroyed Ski Resort Hallway</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>And finally, the nations most prestigious frat, the Secret Service.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GRAPHIC: SECRET SERVICE SEGMENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC (CONT’D)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You may remember them from their 2012 Columbia prostitution scandal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Or more recently, for driving through an active police investigation while drunk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>With us now is the man that was behind the wheel. Agent Brent </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Fontaine</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ALEC"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BRENT"></CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GLEN"></CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. GREEN SCREEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>LOWER THIRD: Secret Service </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Bro</Text>
      <Text>, BRENT </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">FONTAINE</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Brent, thanks for coming on the show!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Brent</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Just kicking it at the White </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Hizzy</Text>
      <Text>, doing my duty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Brent will be noticeably loose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Brent, the media is in a tizzy over your latest gaffe as a member of the secret service. We have video of the incident here, could you please walk us through what was going through your head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BRENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>10-4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>VIDEO: SECRET SERVICE CAR FOOTAGE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Brent (v.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Around this specific moment I was settling the tab at the Pennsylvania Avenue </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Applebees</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Had myself a a number of Mai </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Tais</Text>
      <Text> with my big, Glen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Then we got back to the Whitey </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Hizz</Text>
      <Text> for our shift, and these assholes put a blockade in the driveway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Were you aware there was an active bomb scene investigation going on?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BRENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I WAS aware of the would-be bomb scene in my pants. The Grilled Chicken </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Wonton</Text>
      <Text> Tacos were ready to evacuate and weren’t gonna wait for some cops to move their toys!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Brent high fives over his head to an arm off-screen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who did you just high five?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BRENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh. My big. Glen “Turtle Dove” </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chavitz</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GLEN enters wearing a suit poorly. Shirt untucked, tie around head. Collar messed. He looks like he’s the last man at a raging party. He’s holding a drink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Glen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">dat</Text>
      <Text> calling my name?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>AlEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mr. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chavitz</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>LOWER THIRD: Glen “Turtle Dove” </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chavitz</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GLEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Call me Turtle Dove! Everybody does!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Brent</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Woo! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">T-Dove</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Ok</Text>
      <Text>, Mr. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Chavitz</Text>
      <Text>. What were you thinking when Agent </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Fontaine</Text>
      <Text> plowed through a police barrier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Glen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Alec, to be honest, everyone in the car was more concerned with them </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">wonton</Text>
      <Text> tacos plowing through </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">Agent </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">Fontaine’s</Text>
      <Text> barrier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Have you ever been sitting in a Crown Vic when someone’s actively shitting their pants?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No, thank god!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>While I’ve got you, we’ve heard rumors the Secret Service is building a replica White House for training purposes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GLEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh, you mean Project Party Town?! Hell yeah!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Over the head high five.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Brent</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Gotta train that alcohol tolerance!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>GLEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well I, personally, need to brush up on my </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">cornhole</Text>
      <Text> game.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec is enraged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Alec</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re supposed to be protecting the leader of the free world, and you’re just doing cocaine off of hooker’s asses and drinking yourselves stupid. You’re making a mockery of yourself and the US around the world!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The internet is here, and you’re on the ass end of it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Brent chimes up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Brent</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’ll have you know that we are hard at work bringing the Secret Service into the 21st century.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ALEC</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh? How’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BRENT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>First, the name. Secret Service is </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold">so</Text>
      <Text> last gen. We’re abbreviating like all the trendy startups.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Glen nods along in agreement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Glen</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Word. Starting May 2015 we’re calling ourselves the SS!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Over-the-head high five.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Brent</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Remix!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Glen and Brent start pumping the air to a THUMPING BEAT.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Alec stares quizzically. Then looks to the scoreboard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>DING!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>GRAPHIC: SCOREBOARD PRICKS 8 DECENCY 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>End.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

